						author: "Ichflippgleiaus"
						display: { }
						generation: 3
						pages: [
							"{\"text\":\"Far Far Away in a forgotten dimension, long since lost in the mists of the past, lived a traveler named Erik. He was a man of insatiable curiosity and a never-ending desire for adventure. Erik lived a simple life that revolved around travel and exploration. One day something incredible happened!\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"Erik was traveling in a nearly endless ocean. Suddenly, an inexplicable phenomenon happened. A blinding light enveloped his boat, and he found himself in a strange and unreal dimension. The waves of the ocean had calmed down in the meantime, and Erik was heading for a shore unfamiliar to him....\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"The coast was filled with strange plants and creatures he had never seen in his life before.... Trees towered into the sky, their leaves glimmering in amazing colors. Everything here seemed different...\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"Erik first had to learn the basics of survival in this new world. He discovered that the water here was drinkable, but the fruits he found were completely unknown to him.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"He learned the basics from the locals, who were friendly and welcoming, even though their lifestyles and customs were so completely different from anything Erik had experienced before.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"Over time, he developed a certain skill in dealing with the fauna and flora of this foreign world. He learned how to protect himself from the dangers of the wilderness. But that was only the beginning of his challenges....\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"In this dimension, a completely different order of things existed. The laws of nature known to him seemed to be suspended here. The sun moved across the sky in strange ways, and the nights were often filled with mysterious moments.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"He realized that the inhabitants of this world he called \\\"Luminaris\\\" had amazing abilities. \"}"
							"{\"text\":\"They could communicate with thought, shape matter by pure imagination, and harness the energies of nature into their service. Erik endeavored to learn from them and began to unlock the secrets of this fascinating dimension.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"Erik was stranded here but over time it felt homey.... Nevertheless, Erik kept looking for a way back home. And so he made his way through forgotten portals and rituals to unknown worlds...\"}"
						]
